    "Perform parallel-bar (or ring) dips with a dip belt, vest, or carefully held dumbbell between the legs.",
    "Keep depth in a pain-free range; load only with solid unassisted form."
  ],
  "setup": [
    "Secure belt; prefer parallel bars before heavy ring loading."
  ],
  "breathing": "Brace; exhale to press.",
  "commonMistakes": [
    "Chasing depth under heavy load",
